      "writtenOn": "2021-01-26T00:28:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Killing an IKE session will immediately trigger a SESSION_CLOSED event. The StateMachine documentation notes that calling transitionTo in a enter() method may result in undefined behavior, so I figured we can reuse the same codepath as everything else (as if NETWORK_LOST was triggered).\n\nAdded comment.",
